rom the top of your library until you reveal a creature card with higher mana value. Put that card onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\n[−7]: Each creature you control deals damage equal to its power to each opponent.', '[+1]: You gain 2 life. Add {U}, {R}, or {W}. Spend this mana only to cast a noncreature spell.\n[−2]: Draw a card, then you may discard a card. When you discard a nonland card this way, Narset of the Ancient Way deals damage equal to that card\'s mana value to target creature or planeswalker.\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this emblem deals 2 damage to any target."', "{1}, {T}, Sacrifice another creature: You gain life equal to the sacrificed creature's toughness. Draw a card.", '{1}, {T}: Blisterspit Gremlin deals 1 damage to each opponent.\nWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, untap Blisterspit Gremlin.', '{1}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{1}{B}: Search your library for a card named Whisper Squad, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{1}{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', '{2}, Sacrifice a creature: Weaponize the Monsters deals 2 damage to any target.', '{4}{B}: Return Durable Coilbug from your graveyard to your hand.', '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a creature spell.', '{T}: Add {B} or {G}.\n{T}: Mill two cards.', '{T}: Add {B}, {G}, or {U}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{3}, {T}: Draw a card. Activate only if you control a creature with power 4 or greater.', '{T}: Add {G}, {U}, or {R}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', '{T}: Add {R}, {W}, or {B}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', '{T}: Add {U}, {R}, or {W}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', '{T}: Add {W}, {B}, or {G}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)']
